# ce-ota-finish -- webOS CE: finish an update on the first boot of the new
# image: the cryptofs apps and seed files an OTA payload cannot reach, and
# the boot logo in NVRAM. Exits at once when there is nothing to do, and
# on a flashed device flags itself done before first use.

start on stopped finish

console none

script
    exec sh -e /usr/palm/ce-seed/jobs/ce-ota-finish.sh
end script
